\begin{tabular}{lc}
\toprule
class & factored \\
\midrule
PLUSONE ($p+1\mid M$) & $24/40$ \\
GENERAL & $0/40$ \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
The base $P=2$ was confirmed degenerate ($D=0$), returning $\gcd=N$ on every instance.

